"P1255567872" "{HeroName}, right? My name's <color yellow>Matthew Habashy.</color> I'm with the Federal Bureau of Super Powered Affairs, or the <color yellow>FBSA</color>.<br><br>Are you OK from getting out of Galaxy City?<br><br>I just... barely got out myself."
// Answer Text :
"P2877866649" "Don't worry about me. What's the situation here?"
// Answer Text :
"P2351832913" "I am, but what are we doing to recover it?"
// Page Situation Text :
"P1689707736" "<color yellow>Longow</color> and the <color yellow>Paragon Police Department</color> have devoted all their resources towards containing the situation.<br><br>However... that's left Atlas Park nearly defenseless against <i>other</i> crimes."
// Answer Text :
"P3936346721" "What's the situation in Atlas?"
// Page Recover Text :
"P2719715016" "Atlas Park has seen much better days, {HeroName}. All the refugees from Galaxy City are being sent here, either to find... loved ones that they lost, or for support.<br><br>However, the majority of the police force is fighting in Galaxy City, leaving Atlas ripe for the picking.<br><br>That's why the FBSA sent me down here, to work with heroes like you to try to take back Atlas Park. Are you ready?"
// Answer Text :
"P4124785633" "Let's do this."
// Page Recover2 Text :
"P4000010018" "Atlas Park has seen much better days, {HeroName}. All the refugees from Galaxy City are being sent here, either to find... loved ones that they lost, or for support.<br><br>However, with the majority of the police force fighting in Galaxy City, Atlas is ripe for the picking.<br><br>That's why the FBSA sent me down here, to work with heroes like you to try to take back Atlas Park. Are you ready?"

